      "kind": "commit",
      "commit": {
        "rev": "3n2tpo276z322",
        "operation": "create",
        "collection": "org.tangled.track.ticket",
        "rkey": "359",
        "record": {
          "$type": "org.tangled.track.ticket",
          "body": {
            "$type": "org.tangled.markup.markdown",
            "text": "OOM on coaxmetal 2026-11-21 19:09:49 (global, no swap): kernel task dump = 9.6 GiB agentd agents (26 omp), 7.3 GiB nix build of patched Sunshine (16 cc1plus), 5.2 GiB rustc (continuum agent cargo test). The OOM killer then killed phonetpm, dbus brokers, land-nginx-stream and agentd processes.\n\n- agentd.service: MemoryHigh 45% / MemoryMax 55% (also applies on neoprism, same module).\n- nix-daemon.service on coaxmetal: MemoryHigh 35% / MemoryMax 45%; nix.settings.cores = 4 (was 0 = all 16 per job, x max-jobs 4).\n- zramSwap (zstd, 50% of RAM): root is ZFS with no free partition; swapfiles are unsupported on ZFS and zvol swap can deadlock under memory pressure.\n\nChecked: nix eval of all four settings on coaxmetal (+ agentd on neoprism). Deploy: coaxmetal (restarts agentd and nix-daemon: running agents are interrupted, Hermes restarts too), neoprism optional."
          },
          "createdAt": "2026-11-21T18:19:49Z",
          "state": "open",
          "targetBranch": "master",
          "title": {
            "$type": "org.tangled.markup.markdown#inline",
            "text": "coaxmetal: memory limits for agentd and nix builds, zram swap"
          },
          "x-tngl-editor": "did:plc:vhearieesyugq7ortfgncciv"
        },
        "cid": "bafyreig2afltipdtyfnipabnjscfmee7e3tibpdbofk4hueukdgpzg45vy"
      }
